ype":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て言ったら、blackひなぴょんに無言でバッサリ斬られました(:_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナーゼーーーーー(O_O)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、今度一緒にペット博行ってラマに会ってこようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/17/4959455/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まいまいBlog参照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グダグダBlogになってしまった。\n万理華先輩が読んだらまた、内容が無さ過ぎるとおっしゃりそうですm(__)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして...\nもう見て下さった方もいるかな??\nメガシャキがガムになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/17/5142557/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいＣＭも流れはじめています★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べた感想は、\nあー!!コレは誰でもシャキッとなってしまうゼッ★ て感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......上手く伝わったかな；笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式ホームページにある桜井のメイキングを見たら、意味がわかるはず!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん是非checkしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/17/5142557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/17/5142557/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}